WEBVTT

00:00:02.610 --> 00:00:05.290
The Paradise Prize Dress Live!

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:07.980
Following the shoes and tiara,

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:11.360
today's show finally has the third piece of Paradise Coord up for grabs!

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:16.130
Winning here will mean getting all three items!

00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:20.960
Previously this coord was gathered by the legendary Saints!

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:27.250
ParaPri is said to be the first step toward becoming a Divine Idol! Who will win?

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:29.960
We're almost ready to start!

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:10.190
I was just at the entry counter,

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:13.440
and apparently only 3 teams will compete today-kuma!

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:14.940
What?!

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:19.150
SoLaMi SMILE, Dressing Pafé and Falulu-kuma!

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:21.210
Why? What about the other teams?

00:02:21.210 --> 00:02:24.380
Well, it is finally the finals of ParaPri...

00:02:24.380 --> 00:02:28.460
I think everyone who didn't think  they could win gave up-kuma.

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:32.790
Only those serious about winning are getting on stage-pri!

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:34.920
Well then, we can't lose!

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:35.710
Yes.

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:42.930
Basically, one of these three teams will certainly win the ParaPri-usa.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:46.510
And both are worthy opponents.

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:49.240
Let us fight with all our body and soul!

00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:57.880
Oh, you came here just to lose?

00:02:57.880 --> 00:02:59.700
I think you should consider retiring.

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:02.280
I could say the same to you-pri.

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:06.450
I have no grudge against you,
but prepare to be cut down to size.

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:08.830
We want to win just as much.

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:11.440
Well, if Dorothy says...

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:14.920
No! I mean I want our team to win!

00:03:15.300 --> 00:03:20.590
Uh, uh... Aaah! You said everything already!

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:23.860
Step aside, the champion is coming through.

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:27.560
Move the rubbish out of the way.

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:29.570
Falulu!

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:34.970
Everyone came here to defeat me?

00:03:34.970 --> 00:03:38.440
No, Falulu. They came here to be defeated.

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:41.240
It's on now, Falulu!

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:42.700
Quite so. On it is!

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:45.160
Yeah. It's on.

00:03:51.150 --> 00:03:55.420
Argh, I can't wait! When are they starting?

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:56.950
Eiko!

00:03:57.660 --> 00:04:00.220
Lala's team's gonna win, right?

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:02.690
Of course! Let's all cheer for them!

00:04:02.690 --> 00:04:06.550
What a wonderful display of friendship-glo!

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:08.530
Headmistress.

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:13.980
As an instructor at the PriPara Gym,
I must see the fruits my students' labor-glo.

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:15.270
Don't you agree, instructor Love?

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:18.020
Yes. Love - 40!

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:26.880
Wow! It's the Paradise Coord!

00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:39.460
It's finally time! The Paradise Prize Live is live!

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:41.670
It started!

00:04:41.980 --> 00:04:43.330
Oh, really?

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:45.590
Good luck.

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:49.310
The ideal of idols everywhere. The Paradise Coord.

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:53.770
It's said that when this coord shines on its wearer, a miracle will happen.

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:56.950
However, such a miracle has never been witnessed.

00:04:56.950 --> 00:05:01.780
Because no idol until now has made it shine.

00:05:03.270 --> 00:05:07.150
The legendary Paradise Coord, veiled in mystery.

00:05:07.150 --> 00:05:09.780
Who will claim it theirs?

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:12.700
Without further ado, let's get started!

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:18.040
Entry number one: Dressing Pafé!

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:23.490
Shion, nothing less than victory befits you.

00:05:23.490 --> 00:05:24.510
May you triumph.

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:28.970
Scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your Coord.

00:05:30.690 --> 00:05:33.360
You may also scan Friend Tickets.

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:35.270
Coord Change Start!

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:41.270
Everyone has their own color for the Tiara Prize Live coords.

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:43.710
You're the top batters of ParaPri, good luck!

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:45.860
Nocturne Sky Idol Coord!

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:46.840
Go!

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:47.530
Yay!

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:06.260
<i>We're the greatest in the land.</i>

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:09.290
<i>Dressing Pafé won't lose twice!</i>

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:14.420
<i>The Paradise Coord is ours!</i>

00:06:14.420 --> 00:06:16.890
<i>Together, we can do it!</i>

00:06:30.510 --> 00:06:32.580
Let's <i>go...</i>

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:43.340
Tension max...

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:45.600
Relax...

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:54.010
Dressing Pafé...

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:07.650
Making Drama Switch On!

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:28.950
Stereo Full Blast, 2-3 Rock!

00:07:28.950 --> 00:07:31.580
Is a go!

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:36.560
Cyalume Change!

00:07:38.670 --> 00:07:40.770
Team Cyalume!

00:07:42.220 --> 00:07:42.920
Yay!

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:43.690
Go!

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:21.180
Dressing Pafé is the best!

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:21.760
I love you!

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:22.850
Alright!

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:27.360
The classic Idol Coord with its prominent gingham checks.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:30.110
All matched up for maximizing teamwork!

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:32.540
Wish Ribbon Idol Coord!

00:08:33.190 --> 00:08:34.010
Pri!

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:40.950
And here's our entry number two!

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:42.580
SoLaMi SMILE!

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:44.780
Looking good, Lady Sophie!

00:08:44.780 --> 00:08:46.520
Looking great-chanko!

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:48.540
Cosmic cheering for you!

00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:55.130
<i>See the sky and smile. So everyone can smile!</i>

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:58.390
<i>We'll get a sum greater than our parts!</i>

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:01.490
<i>Performing is so fun!</i>

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:47.180
Prism Voice...

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:01.700
SoLaMi SMILE... Shiny.

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:09.580
Making Drama Switch On!

00:10:11.330 --> 00:10:12.340
Twinkle!

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:14.630
Twinkle twink!

00:10:15.730 --> 00:10:17.130
Twinkle twinkle!

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:22.430
Twinkle twinkle twinkle!

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:25.030
This is our Making Drama!

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:26.910
Night Sky...

00:10:29.280 --> 00:10:33.020
Moonlight Traveling!

00:10:34.430 --> 00:10:36.950
Cyalume Change!

00:11:13.570 --> 00:11:16.080
SoLaMi SMILE is the best!

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:19.410
A wonderful showing from both.

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:23.070
Neither Dressing Pafé or SoLaMi SMILE is giving an inch.

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:28.080
And after the break, we finally have last round's winner: Falulu!

00:11:29.440 --> 00:11:32.040
Wow, but that was a wondeful show!

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:37.520
Let's go show off the Paradise Coord to that bunny idiot after our victory is confimed!

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:41.010
Please, your dinky little ears are joke enough.

00:11:41.350 --> 00:11:42.480
What?

00:11:42.480 --> 00:11:47.470
The ones to get the Paradise Coord are surely my babies here!

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:49.910
SoLaMi SMILE will win-pri!

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:51.700
No, Dressing Pafé!

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:53.900
You can't have our Paradise Coord!

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:57.210
We want the Paradise Coord too!

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:03.330
The little rubbish idols planning to get the Paradise Coord?

00:12:05.510 --> 00:12:06.910
That's ridiculous.

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:09.200
What are you saying is ridiculous-kuma?!

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:11.620
Rubbish? I demand satisfaction-usa!

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:17.780
Huh? Did the rubbish mascot say something? Could you run that by me again?

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:19.020
Uh, well...

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:22.340
I... I do think your wording was a mite harsh...

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:25.510
I simply called rubbish rubbish!

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:29.360
You don't have the slightest idea of Falulu's true power!

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:32.310
This next show will reduce you to tears!

00:12:36.240 --> 00:12:37.200
Wait.

00:12:37.810 --> 00:12:38.730
What?

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:42.350
Was Falulu really born in PriPara?

00:12:42.350 --> 00:12:45.450
And destined to be at the top?

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:47.240
That's right.

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:49.600
Was she really born in PriPara?

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:51.080
You don't give up, do you?

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:54.920
I saw it with my own two eyes, I'll have you know.

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:56.320
What?

00:12:56.320 --> 00:13:03.550
To begin with, I'm a mascot with a special mission, unlike those two piles of garbage.

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:05.050
A special mission?

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:09.010
Research on the Paradise Coord.

00:13:09.630 --> 00:13:14.980
I was researching methods to make the legendary Paradise Coord shine.

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:18.940
Divine Idols wearing it didn't do the trick...

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:24.400
We must find someone to go beyond even a Divine Idol.

00:13:25.690 --> 00:13:30.090
I went around looking for one who had the potential to be a Divine Idol,

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:33.120
but that isn't an easy thing to find.

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:35.600
But just when I was ready to give up...

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:44.430
hm? A PriTicket?

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:47.970
Falulu...

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:50.670
A PriTicket without an owner.

00:13:50.670 --> 00:13:52.990
I thought of discarding it, but...

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:58.080
But the girl on it was really cute.

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:31.650
Ever since that day, Falulu has been my everything.

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:41.440
You came from the PriTicket?

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:44.670
Falulu?

00:14:46.050 --> 00:14:47.670
Falulu?

00:14:48.660 --> 00:14:50.360
And that was when I remembered!

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:56.080
The legend of the Vocal Doll, born to be the ultimate idol.

00:14:56.480 --> 00:14:58.540
Come over here!

00:14:59.050 --> 00:15:00.500
Take a look at this.

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:03.310
Take a look at this?

00:15:25.180 --> 00:15:26.950
She just saw it once, and...

00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:30.150
Right then, I was sure.

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:34.120
She was indeed the one who would surpass Divine Idolhood.

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:38.620
The one who will make the Paradise Coord shine and cause a miracle.

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:50.130
Th-This is...

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:52.340
The Prism Voice!

00:16:01.580 --> 00:16:08.480
Since then, I've shown Falulu concerts every day and taught her about idols.

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:15.320
She has made such rapid progress, she's become perfect idol.

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:17.910
That's why I signed her up for ParaPri now.

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:21.410
She's come this far in just half a year...

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:26.190
Oh! That's why she seemed so different every time we met.

00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:29.090
Just what is Falulu's power?

00:16:29.890 --> 00:16:34.600
Falulu can perfectly recreate anything she sees only once.

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:40.060
She already has the combined power of hundreds of idols, but shows no signs of stopping.

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:43.520
That's why you have no hope of ever beating Falulu.

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:49.940
You will serve as mere stepping stones on Falulu's way to surpassing Divine Idolhood.

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:52.430
You should be proud.

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:01.210
Welcome back to the ParaPri finals!

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:03.330
It's finally time for our last performer!

00:17:03.740 --> 00:17:06.840
Entry number three: Falulu!

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:16.400
<i>SoLaMi SMILE, Dressing Pafé...</i>

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:18.180
<i>Shiny...</i>

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:27.210
Making Drama Switch On!

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:29.540
Twinkle twinkle!

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:38.970
Night Sky Moonlight Traveling!

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:39.760
What?

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:40.890
That's...

00:18:40.890 --> 00:18:43.220
Our Making Drama-pri!

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:50.240
Exciting Present For You!

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:53.690
Fresh Sweets Park!

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:01.560
Liberation Maiden Valkyria!

00:19:02.310 --> 00:19:06.030
Stereo Full Blast 2-3 Rock!

00:19:06.030 --> 00:19:08.230
Is a go!

00:19:08.990 --> 00:19:13.790
Full-speed Dash! Fly, Balloons!

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:15.070
What is this?

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:17.440
Even our Making Dramas...

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:19.300
I can't believe this!

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:23.910
Believe in dreams!

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:27.400
Frozen Castle!

00:19:27.400 --> 00:19:31.240
Mirage!

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:35.640
Cyalume Change!

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:05.040
You're the best, Falulu!

00:20:05.040 --> 00:20:06.680
I love you Falulu!

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:07.470
She's too perfect!

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:08.730
You're the best!

00:20:08.730 --> 00:20:09.960
I'm so moved!

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:11.000
You're the best!

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:13.060
I know you'll win, Lady Falulu!

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:24.170
And the winner of all three Paradise Coord items is Falulu!

00:20:24.170 --> 00:20:26.910
Give her another big round of applause, everyone!

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:33.030
We've been destroyed. And I had such confidence in our victory this time...

00:20:33.030 --> 00:20:35.120
We didn't even come close.

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:38.230
And you can only participate in ParaPri once...

00:20:38.230 --> 00:20:41.130
We lost our chance to get the Paradise Coord.

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:45.190
Damn it! Why did she have to show up?

00:20:45.190 --> 00:20:46.600
No fair!

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:49.310
Incredible...

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:56.710
Lady Falulu!

00:20:56.710 --> 00:20:57.650
Lovely!

00:20:57.650 --> 00:21:01.560
Look, Lala! Falulu has so many fans!

00:21:01.560 --> 00:21:03.980
Yeah! That's great!

00:21:03.980 --> 00:21:05.560
Congrats on the win.

00:21:05.560 --> 00:21:07.240
You're happy too?

00:21:07.240 --> 00:21:13.210
Y-Yeah. Losing is frustrating,
but since we're friends, I'm happy for you!

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:16.920
Friends? Aren't you my fan?

00:21:17.220 --> 00:21:17.880
Huh?

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:23.380
Unicorn said to me idols only need fans.

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:27.110
So when are you coming to challenge Falulu again?

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:29.940
I can't wait.

00:21:29.940 --> 00:21:31.060
I'll be waiting for you.

00:21:31.950 --> 00:21:33.280
Falulu...

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:09.240
What a shock! We lost to Falulu!

00:23:09.580 --> 00:23:11.490
We can't beat Falulu the way we are now.

00:23:11.940 --> 00:23:14.740
We'll have to put SoLaMi SMILE on hiatus.

00:23:14.740 --> 00:23:16.240
What? Hiatus?

00:23:16.240 --> 00:23:18.870
I can't take any more...

00:23:18.870 --> 00:23:20.350
Pshu...

00:23:20.350 --> 00:23:23.880
H-Hey, come on, guys! Let's get some shows done!

00:23:23.880 --> 00:23:27.080
PriPara doesn't need idols who can't smile.

00:23:27.080 --> 00:23:28.840
Seriously?

00:23:29.450 --> 00:23:32.670
Next time: Smile! SoLaMi SMILE
